(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[102]={"source_order":102,"notes":["Very faint pencil could be hidden by the show-through. No legible independent writing was identified apart from the folio number.","The page is the verso of fol. 51. The adjacent fol. 51 and fol. 52 entries are context only and were not transcribed.","The ghosted text visible across the page is show-through or offset, not original writing on fol. 51b.","Every native tile was reviewed: top, middle and bottom, both margins, and the gutter. Apart from the folio number '51ᵇ', no writing belonging to this page was found. The ruled lines are empty.","Faint ghosted handwriting shows across the ruled area. This is show-through or offset from the other side of the leaf (fol. 51), and it is not transcribed as text of this page.","There are small dark specks and short diagonal dashed streaks in the middle of the page, at roughly x 1650–2070 and y 1715–2260, with a small cluster near x 1340, y 2120. They look like smudges or offset rather than writing.","The page is classed as blank for catalogue content. This finding is based on review of the images.","Faint ghosted handwriting covers the ruled area. The candidate and inventory both attribute it to show-through from fol. 51, the recto of this leaf. It could instead be, or include, offset from the facing fol. 52. Mirror-reversed ghost text cannot settle this, because offset from the facing page would also appear reversed. The ghosting runs right to the bottom of the page. On fol. 51 the writing appears to stop lower down, at about 1350/1500 of that image's height, while fol. 52 is written almost to the bottom. Which side the ghosting comes from is therefore not established. Either way it is not text of fol. 51b.","There are minor stray marks not listed in the inventory. One is a small diagonal tick near native x 725, y 1605. Another is a faint dashed diagonal near x 1070–1125, y 2190–2250. A small curl sits near the bottom edge at about x 2794, y 4816. Isolated dots are scattered elsewhere. All look like debris or offset rather than writing. They are not legible and none appears to be a note or holding."],"records":[{"id":"css-prod-0102-r001","local_id":"r001","source_order":102,"folio":"51b","folio_label":"fol. 51b","sequence":1,"page_id":"ce33c593-7278-4539-b1cd-75d4d6be0b88","kind":"other","record_type":"non_catalogue_text","source_model_record_type":"non_catalogue_text","subtype":"folio_number","shelfmark":"","titleLiteral":"","titleNormalized":"","displayTitle":"Catalogue text","authorOrSource":"","source":"","subject":"","subjectGroup":"","date":"","extent":"","lines":"","script":"","incipit":"","transcription":"51ᵇ","annotations":["Pencil folio number in the top left corner, with a superscript b."],"uncertainties":["The superscript is read as 'b'. It matches the supplied folio label.","Faint ghosted handwriting covers the ruled area. The candidate and inventory both attribute it to show-through from fol. 51, the recto of this leaf. It could instead be, or include, offset from the facing fol. 52. Mirror-reversed ghost text cannot settle this, because offset from the facing page would also appear reversed. The ghosting runs right to the bottom of the page. On fol. 51 the writing appears to stop lower down, at about 1350/1500 of that image's height, while fol. 52 is written almost to the bottom. Which side the ghosting comes from is therefore not established. Either way it is not text of fol. 51b.","There are minor stray marks not listed in the inventory. One is a small diagonal tick near native x 725, y 1605. Another is a faint dashed diagonal near x 1070–1125, y 2190–2250. A small curl sits near the bottom edge at about x 2794, y 4816. Isolated dots are scattered elsewhere. All look like debris or offset rather than writing. They are not legible and none appears to be a note or holding."],"focused_readings":[],"reviewNotes":[],"editorialNotes":[],"relationships":[],"editorial_context":[],"block_ids":["b001"],"locations":[{"block_id":"b001","bbox":[395,300,125,75]}],"isCancelled":false,"needsReview":true,"human_verified":false,"verification_status":"machine_reviewed","change_audit":[],"sourceCitationURL":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/ce33c593-7278-4539-b1cd-75d4d6be0b88.json","auditPath":"audit/pages/0102.json","attachedNotes":[],"resolvedRelationships":[],"attachedRecords":[]}]};
